description = "Leveraging [PAWN_possessive] childhood experience, [PAWN_nameDef] became a computer engineer. [PAWN_pronoun] also learned to craft delicate sculptures and random electronics for fun.\n\n[PAWN_nameDef] became fond of technology and mostly gave up on talking to people. Using computers as friends has left [PAWN_nameDef] unable to care for others."
